# Orastery Woes (windurst 86): 579 without the club and its options. Accepted by GM with the guide alone: 579 (param
# 0), option 0, 2 and 4 (nothing); option 1 with a full bag (giveItem fails: nothing); option 1 (the club, 0 weapon
# skill points); the club traded: 580 (no finish handler); 579 (param 2), the Map to the Annals of Truth given by GM
# while it is open, option 3: the quest deleted, the guide and the map taken. Then available, Club 0: not offered (nothing).
lists PortWindurst/Kuroido-Moido/onTrigger PortWindurst/Kuroido-Moido/onTrade PortWindurst/onEventFinish/579
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-110.7,-4.25,102.06 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.MakingAmends completed
quest Windurst.OrasteryWoes accepted
keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
login
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # accepted, no key items, no club: event 579 (0, Club of Trials, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=0                                     # nothing
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # 579 again
finish option=2                                     # neither 1 nor 3: nothing
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # 579 again
finish option=4                                     # nothing
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # 579 again
fill-inventory
finish option=1                                     # no club, the bag full: giveItem fails (its message)
free-inventory
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # 579 again
finish option=1                                     # no club: the Club of Trials (0 weapon skill points)
walk -110.7,-4.25,102.06
trade Kuroido-Moido+7 ClubOfTrials x1                     # 0 weapon skill points: event 580
finish                                              # 580 has no finish handler: the club kept
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # the club held: 579 (..., 2)
keyitem MapToTheAnnalsOfTruth                       # the map given by GM while 579 is open
finish option=3                                     # the quest deleted; the guide and the map taken
trigger Kuroido-Moido+7                                   # available, Club 0: not offered; nothing (his script: Making Amends completed, fame below level 4: nothing; no default)
